# ============================================================
#  Binance ETF Monitor — 全局忽略规则
#  按类别分区,新增条目请保持分区语义,便于审计。
#  注意: 路径默认已**不**递归,需要递归的请用 **/<name>/ 显式标注。
# ============================================================

# ===== OS metadata =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ===== Python (recursively) =====
**/__pycache__/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/htmlcov/
**/.tox/
**/.nox/
*.egg-info/
**/*.egg-info/
.eggs/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/env/
**/ENV/
**/.pyre/
**/.pytype/

# ===== Android / Gradle (recursively) =====
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/
**/local.properties
**/captures/
*.iml
*.hprof
**/.cxx/
**/app/release/
**/app/debug/

# ===== APK / AAB build artifacts =====
*.apk
*.aab

# ===== Android signing (sensitive, recursive) =====
*.jks
**/*.jks
**/keystore.properties
**/keystore/*.keystore
**/keystore/*.jks

# ===== Local-only worktrees & AI workspace =====
.worktrees/
.workbuddy/

# ===== IDE / editor =====
.idea/
.vscode/
.fleet/
.idea_modules/
*.ipr
*.iws
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn
*~

# ===== Environment & secrets (recursive) =====
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.env
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.cer
**/secrets/
secrets.yaml
secrets.json
credentials.*
**/credentials.*

# ===== Runtime artifacts (this project writes to output/) =====
output/
logs/
reports/
data/
tmp/
temp/
*.log
*.log.*
*.pid
*.sock
nohup.out

# ===== Local databases & caches =====
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.cache
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.db
**/*.cache

# ===== OS scratch / editor backups =====
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
*.rej
**/*.bak
**/*.tmp
**/*.orig
**/*.rej

# ===== Jupyter / notebook =====
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ===== Coverage / profiling =====
coverage.xml
**/coverage.xml
*.gcda
*.gcno
profile.json

# ===== Chaquopy embedded Python (Android build) =====
# Android `app/build/python/` 是 Chaquopy 构建时生成的嵌入式 venv;
# **/build/ 已拦截,但此处冗余声明以提高可读性。
**/app/build/python/

# ===== Local marker files (Android runtime state) =====
.last_run
**/.last_run
